# triton (inference server) - the knobs live in the QUADLET's Environment=
# lines (triton.container), not in an env file:
#
#   ACTIVE_MODEL      which model dir tritonserver loads (explicit mode)
#   CONFIG_PROFILE    onnx | tensorrt - the config file name
#                    (model_repository/<model>/<profile>.pbtxt, baked into
#                    the image). Must match the model's artifact:
#                    rtdetr-x -> tensorrt (.engine), yolo26x -> onnx (.onnx)
#
# The model files are LXD mounts (ro), never in the image - swapping a
# model = ship the new file to the models dir + restart triton.
